{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.HabiroPochhammerBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.HabiroPochhammerBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HabiroPochhammerBridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HabiroPochhammerBridge","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/habiro-pochhammer-bridge.lean#L27-L37","doc":"The Pochhammer product factorises:\n`Π_{j=1}^{m} (1 - q^j) = Π_{j=1}^{m} (1 - u^j) · Π_{j=1}^{m} (1 + u^j)`\nwhen `q = u²`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:habiro-pochhammer-bridge","label":"prop:habiro-pochhammer-bridge","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/habiro-pochhammer-bridge.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.pochhammer_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.pochhammer_factor","kind":"theorem","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/habiro-pochhammer-bridge.lean#L23-L25","doc":"For `q = u²`, `1 - q^k = (1 - u^k)(1 + u^k)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.one_sub_sq_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.one_sub_sq_factor","kind":"theorem","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/habiro-pochhammer-bridge.lean#L20-L21","doc":"The fundamental factorisation: `1 - u² = (1 - u)(1 + u)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}